#: ../../talk/calendar_integration.rst:7
msgid "If calendar events have a Talk conversation set as event location, you will see information about upcoming events inside of this conversation. That way you can stay informed about scheduled meetings or activities directly within your chat. If Calendar app is enabled, you can click on an event to view details."
