msgid "Nextcloud Calendar new event dialog with Talk conversation link option"
msgstr ""

#: ../../talk/calendar_integration.rst:31
msgid "When the event is created, you will see a link to the conversation in the event details. The conversation will also appear in the list of conversations (discoverable by the ``Meeting conversations`` filter)."
msgstr ""

